    47	//!
    48	//! ## What "resolved" means here
    49	//!
    50	//! There is no type checker. Every call and relation carries a
    51	//! [`Confidence`](sealmap_model::Confidence):
    52	//!
    53	//! * `exact`: resolved through explicit paths, imports or declared types to a
